# A missing build file (e.g. an old chunk after a redeploy) is a real 404, not the app's HTML:
# the import then fails at once and the app offers "Try again". Existing files are served as
# usual (these rules are not forced). The same goes for the OCR files: the app's HTML must never
# be cached for a year in place of a missing script.
/assets/*  /404.html  404
/ocr/*  /404.html  404
/*  /index.html  200
